  (text "Pulse-Reaper v1.0 — TDR-Guided Non-Invasive Covert Tap for Twisted-Pair Copper Cables\nAuthor: jayis1 — CERN-OHL-S v2 / GPL-2.0\n\nKey signal paths:\n  TDR: MCU->FPGA->SRD->TDR_Plate->Jacket->AD9203->FPGA->MCU\n  Sniff: Clamp->LMH5401(ISO)->FPGA(FIR EQ + bit-slicer)->MCU(parser)->SD/BLE\n  Inject: MCU->FPGA->THS3491->Clamp (jacket-coupled, unpowered buses only)\n  BLE C2: MCU(USART3)->nRF52840->BLE5.0->App (AES-256-CTR, ECDH P-256)\n  Isolation: ISO7741 (5kV) between clamp AFE and digital domain"
    (at 110 200 0) (size 1.5))
